  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">이혁규 교수님 강의에서 질문을 하셨다.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">프로교사가 되기 위한 6가지 조건은?</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">나의 대답 :</span></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">1. 수업 준비를 위한 시간 투자 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: 1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">만 시간</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">자신의 수업에 대한 성찰</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">3. 성찰을 통한 자기 연찬</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">4. 기록</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">5. 자신의 경험을 다른 교사들과 나누는 것</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">6. 이 모든 것을 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">열정</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">을 갖고 즐겨야 한다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">교수님의 답 : &nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">1. 우수한 교육기술</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">방법을 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">가지 체득</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">2. 우수한 교사의 수업을 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">회 참관</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">3. 연구 리포트 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">편 쓰기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">4. 연구 수업을 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">회 실시</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">5. 연구회에 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">번 참가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">6. 자기의 돈을 내서 배워야 함</span></p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><p><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo8;\"><br></p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(간직하고&nbsp;싶은 이야기)</span></strong></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">1. 나의 습관에 대해 의심하는 것부터 </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수업 전문성은 시작된다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo8;\">2. 자신의 수업에 대해 <!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 직설적으로 이야기해도 서로 상처받지 않는 모임</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 상처를 넘어 성장할 수 있는 모임되기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo8;\"></p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo8;\">3. <span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">어떤 수업이 교과적 특성을 지니는 것이 그렇게 중요한가</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 국어수업다운 것이란 무엇인가</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. 수업에 대해 자유롭게 질문하는 분위기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 그 질문들에 대한 답을 기존연구에서 찾아보는 것</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 그것이 수업 연구이다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">5. <span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수업에 대해 학교에서 논의하는 것이 충돌과 집단적인 합의의 과정에서 넘어서 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 수업은 Science</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">가 되어야 한다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">'누구나 경험하지만 누구도 잘 모르는 수업'의 저자 사인을 받았다. 흐뭇~<br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2565C13656A632700B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"519\" height=\"352\" style=\"width: 519px; height: 352px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20160125_233258323.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"960\"  id=\"A_2565C13656A632700B55CC\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><br></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">몇 년전 배움의 공동체 손우정 교수님의 스케줄을 본적이 있다. </span></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">전국투어~ (</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">하루에도 2개 이상의 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">연수강의로 꽉 차 있었다)</span></font></span></p><p><br></p><p><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">이혁규 교수님도 이곳 강의가 끝나고&nbsp;오후에도 수업비평 특강이</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> 다른 곳에서 또 있다고 하신다.</span></font></p><p><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">학교현장을 연구의 대상으로 삼고 계시는 분인데</span></font></p><p><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">현장연구에 대한 애정과&nbsp;에너지가&nbsp;강의로 소진될까봐 걱정이 든다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><p>(오늘 강의도&nbsp;많이 준비하지 못하셨다는 것을 강의 서두에서 말씀하셨다)</p><p><br></p></span><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">핀란드 교사는&nbsp;일과 시간의 절반은 수업을 하고,&nbsp;</span><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">나머지 절반은 수업연구를 한다.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><br></p></font><p><br></p><p>요것도 한 번 읽어주세요~</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DIIg%26dataid%3D92%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20160125233056&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile294.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F21597B4256A6377C2BB2E6')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 학문과_학교교과와의_차이.pdf</a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><br></font></p><p><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><br></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><br></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}